# LGPL FFmpeg 9.0 shared build bundled with the .deb/.rpm and the Windows
# installer (BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds; `-lgpl-shared` has no GPL code: H.264 comes
# from NVENC/VAAPI/QSV/AMF/Media Foundation or OpenH264, not libx264).
# BtbN prunes old autobuild tags after a few weeks: when a download 404s,
# pick the newest autobuild with the same 9.0 branch and update all four
# values from its release page (the asset digests are listed there).
